<title>POLAND: Polish PEPEES down five pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Polish PEPEES down five pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food producer PEPEES SA started trade on the main market of the Warsaw Stock Exchange at 114 zlotys, five percent below Monday's public offering strike price of 120 zlotys.</p>
<p>On Monday 152,100 of the firm's shares were sold at a special bourse session at which buy orders were reduced at an average allotment rate of 46.4 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
